TI  - Deep Learning in Airborne Particulate Matter Sensing and Surface Plasmon Resonance for Environmental Monitoring
PY  - 2025
T2  - Atmosphere
VL  - 16
IS  - 4
C7  - 359
DO  - 10.3390/atmos16040359
