AB  - The correlation coefficient for all comparison measurements was greater than 0.85, proving a strong positive relationship. The T640 has many advantages, including the ability to measure all three parameters with one instrument. The T640 effectively measured PM parameters with very little maintenance and with accurate real-time data readings. Overall, the T640 would be a reasonable replacement for BAM instruments for compliance measurements of NAAQS requirements. © 2017 Air and Waste Management Association. All rights reserved.
